-- ============================================================
-- One-time backfill: example_en for cards uploaded before the
-- example_en column existed (run AFTER 0005_example_en.sql).
--
-- Matches on (word_de, example_de), which is a unique pair across
-- the German B1 vocabulary set this generates from. Safe to run
-- more than once. Cards that don't match anything here (e.g. a
-- custom deck you typed yourself) are left as '', which just
-- falls back to showing example_ru.
-- ============================================================
